{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297923","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297923","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029792301:1":{"text":"오늘도 여행객 호위하느라 고생 많았어요. 자, 수프 좀 들어요!","source_cn":"今天也辛苦你护送旅客了，来，喝碗热汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43A9DFD94DA2C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792302:1":{"text":"과일은 필요 없나요? 빵은요? 제가 직접 만든 훈제 소시지도 있는데.","source_cn":"水果要不要？还是面包？或者我亲自熏的火腿——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x137A92F12CEC9535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792303:1":{"text":"아뇨, 괜찮습니다. 수프로 몸을 녹이면 충분합니다.","source_cn":"不，多谢，我喝口汤暖暖身子就可以了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D9FC8F4EBF546CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792304:1":{"text":"너무 많이 먹으면 몸이 둔해지고 머리도 잘 안 돌아가거든요.","source_cn":"吃太多会影响身体灵活，脑子也会变迟钝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD347ABAE194E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792305:1":{"text":"하지만 오늘 일이 다 끝났으니 제대로 앉아서 식사도 해야죠.","source_cn":"但今天的工作已经完成了，你就应该坐下来好好吃点东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA844615EF1AC557F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792306:1":{"text":"온천도 하고, 푹 자고 나면 내일을 또 활기차게 시작할 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"泡个温泉，睡一觉，第二天又是精神百倍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAAED8CAB692D5ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792307:1":{"text":"아뇨, 괜찮습니다. 온천에 들어갔다 나오면, 말리는 데 너무 시간이 걸리거든요.","source_cn":"不，多谢了，泡温泉要晾干实在太花时间了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5058415B6A18CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792308:1":{"text":"눈으로 몸을 닦아도 충분히 깨끗해지고 정신도 듭니다.","source_cn":"我用雪稍微擦擦就足够干净，也能提神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2BD6513E9A26B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792309:1":{"text":"그건 너무 고생 아닌가요? 안 되겠어요. 오늘만큼은 제대로 대접해야겠네요!","source_cn":"你过得也太艰苦了！不行，今天必须坐下来，好好吃一顿大餐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32F68C9A041EB568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029792310:1":{"text":"가, 감사합니다.","source_cn":"那……那就多谢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6CFC3C8E1F5761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}